<p data-view-transition-status>Checking whether your browser supports cross-page view transitions…</p>
<p>Try it: open <a href="/demos/instant-navigation/">Instant Navigation</a>, <a href="/demos/">all demos</a>, or <a href="/blog/">the blog</a>, then come back. The page content fades across while the header stays perfectly still, because it's captured as its own piece of the transition.</p>
<noscript><p>The transitions themselves are pure CSS and work without JavaScript; only this status line needs it.</p></noscript>
